    "campaign": {
      "revision": "campaign-r2-hybrid-full-v1-parent-review-pending",
      "instructions": "Use case: ads-marketing. Print only supplied Simplified Chinese artwork text. Professional operational Chinese: clear reconciliation objects and responsible team, concise question and practical next step. Use supplied mainland terminology, not word-for-word Vietnamese syntax. No assumptions about national personality, certification or guaranteed results. Keep original scene and narrative order. Preserve Simplified Chinese glyphs and exact supplied punctuation. Never mix scripts or use pseudo-Chinese. Use ASCII parentheses for approved acronym definitions to remain compatible with the frozen gate; do not normalize other punctuation. Review Chinese punctuation at line starts/ends and mixed Latin terms at 333px; reduce scene area before shrinking type. New artwork in the B13v5 visual family: bright white/pale blue, grounded daylight, navy/blue type, material depth. No English/Vietnamese reference wording. Supplied Latin Digiwin, ERP, MES, domain and exact legal company name are intentional proper literals. Official supplied logo once; no additional DIGIWIN header label. Category and sequence are separate from source, exact near logo. Headline dominant and body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Every source is a full-width normal main paragraph on WHITE, at least body-sized, high contrast, with complete legal name on its own readable line. Reserve bottom35percent for source/CTA when long; shrink scene before type. No source icon column, tiny footer/divider, skyline/pagoda/map/customer facility/seal/badge, unapproved punctuation, chart/tick/data glyphs or technical UI. All paper surfaces blank. No copy of English labels, reference wording or exact composition. Narrative/props stay within the reviewed concept. Exact counter and category required; CTA only if supplied."
    },
    "closing": {
      "revision": "po-closing-b-structural-guide-v1",
      "instructions": "Transfer reviewed B source-after-image structural hierarchy ONLY. Keep complete body separate; exact source once as full-width main paragraph at least body-sized, comfortable nozoom317–333px; CTA separate. Reduce photo before font. No skyline/icon column/footer, copied words/data/props/fixed counts. Cohort-appropriate grounded scene and exact approved artwork only.",
